      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think I've figured it out. Changing the FBX resulted in a Target Renderer slot of my write-to-material contact receiver being null. When a slot is null, the avatar is broken. I'll leave the avatar as-is for now in case you want to confirm this, but it should be easy to reproduce.",
